  "body": "Looking at the algorithms after fixing #81, it's very clear that the queues need to be a bit more first-class. Most obviously, separately tracking `[[queue]]` and `[[queueCount]]` is not good.\n\nThe most obvious thing to do is define a spec-internal queue data structure that takes care of some of this all at once.\n\nMore ambitiously, it might be possible to merge the queue into the queuing strategy object itself. Not entirely sure how that will work, but I see some glimpses. Will sleep on it.\n",
